  m_Name: S_BodyPresence
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ComponentData
  componentName: Body Presence Sensor
  plcName: dp
  plcAddress: 0.08
  description: "Model                        : OMRON E2A-M12KS04WPB1\r\nType                         
    : Inductive Proximity Sensor\r\nThread Size              : M12\r\nSensing Distance    
    : 4 mm\r\nCable Type               : PVC Pre-wired\r\nMounting                 
    : Bottom of feeder magazine / rejection area\r\nOutput Type             : Digital
    PNP NO\r\nPLC Signal                : dp\r\nPLC Input Address   : 0.08\r\n\nDetects
    body presence at the feeder base (empty magazine alert) and confirms rejection
    cylinder position. The PLC uses dp / d\u0304p to branch between normal cycle
    return (S1) and error recovery (S30)."
